{"id":2516,"date":"2026-06-16T10:30:15","date_gmt":"2026-06-16T10:30:15","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/?post_type=careers&#038;p=2516"},"modified":"2026-06-23T07:13:47","modified_gmt":"2026-06-23T07:13:47","slug":"ai-analytics-and-dashboard-engineer","status":"publish","type":"careers","link":"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/careers\/ai-analytics-and-dashboard-engineer\/","title":{"rendered":"AI ANALYTICS AND DASHBOARD ENGINEER\u00a0"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Data Platforms and Reporting | A4I Lab (IIIT-B x Microsoft)&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Organization: A4I Lab (IIIT-B x Microsoft)&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Location: IIIT&nbsp;Bangalore&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Type: Contract (through March 2027, extendable)&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Experience: 3 to 5 years&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>About A4I Lab&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">AI Innovation and Inclusion Initiative (A4I) is a partnership between Microsoft and IIIT-B, working with non-profit partners to apply AI to real-world challenges in education, healthcare, accessibility, and agriculture.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Role Overview<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We are looking for an Analytics and Dashboard Engineer to lead reporting and data&nbsp;visualisation&nbsp;across A4I\u2019s AI platforms. You will build scalable pipelines, reporting models, and dashboards that support both internal teams and&nbsp;programme&nbsp;stakeholders while strengthening data-driven decision-making across the&nbsp;organisation.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>What You Will Do<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Deploy and&nbsp;maintain&nbsp;BI platforms such as Apache Superset.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Build ETL and ELT pipelines in Python across multiple data sources.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Design reporting-ready data models and analytical dashboards.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Define and track metrics for platform usage, AI performance, and&nbsp;programme&nbsp;outcomes.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Create dashboards for monitoring, adoption tracking, and stakeholder reporting.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Write maintainable SQL and Python code with clear documentation.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Collaborate with cross-functional teams and mentor junior engineers.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Required Qualifications<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 3 to 5 years of experience in analytics engineering, BI, or data engineering.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Strong SQL skills and experience with analytical data modelling.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Hands-on experience building production ETL or ELT pipelines in Python.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Experience with BI tools such as Superset,&nbsp;Metabase, or&nbsp;Redash.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Understanding of&nbsp;access control and reporting permissions.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022&nbsp;Strong communication&nbsp;and collaboration skills.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Preferred Qualifications<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Experience with Apache Superset and dashboard embedding.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Familiarity with Airflow, Prefect,&nbsp;Dagster, or&nbsp;dbt.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Experience with Azure, AWS, or GCP.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Prior exposure to social impact or mission-driven&nbsp;organisations.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Apply<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Please send your resume to a4i@iiitb.ac.in<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Subject line: Application for AI Analytics and Dashboard Engineer <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>A4I Lab is committed to building AI systems that serve everyone. We actively encourage applications from candidates of all backgrounds, disciplines, and geographies.<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><\/h2>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Data Platforms and Reporting | A4I Lab (IIIT-B x Microsoft)&nbsp; Organization: A4I Lab (IIIT-B x Microsoft)&nbsp; Location: IIIT&nbsp;Bangalore&nbsp; Type: Contract (through March 2027, extendable)&nbsp; Experience: 3 to 5 years&nbsp; About A4I Lab&nbsp; AI Innovation and Inclusion Initiative (A4I) is a partnership between Microsoft and IIIT-B, working with non-profit partners to apply AI to real-world challenges [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":0,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"categories":[],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-2516","careers","type-careers","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/careers\/2516","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/careers"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/careers"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2516"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/w